  "description": "Emilia, an orphan born in a quiet rural village, is a clumsy maid wandering without a proper job until she gets the chance to serve a noble count. Grateful for the employment, she tries her best, but nothing ever goes as planned. Yesterday she broke a teacup; the day before she killed all the flowers in the garden. And today... she even sat right on her master's face. \n\n'Between my legs... Something is poking down there.'    \n\n'Ah~ It's the master's high nose bridge!'    \n\n'How high must it be to fit right into that hole!' \n\nThe clumsy, blunder-filled, slapstick romance story of Emilia the clutzy maid.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14598841)",
